      <pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>从写好一篇 Markdown 到线上可访问，中间有几步是必须的：schema 校验、base 前缀、索引重建、发布验证。这份记录可当作模板复用。</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>这个博客是怎么搭的：Astro 静态站点的取舍清单</title>
      <link>https://wild-think-lab.github.io/wild-think/writing/how-this-blog-is-built/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://wild-think-lab.github.io/wild-think/writing/how-this-blog-is-built/</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>从主题选型、内容模型、路由设计到搜索引擎与部署，说明一个纯静态技术博客的完整技术决策，以及为什么放弃 Tailwind 与第三方统计。</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>项目：KingLinux 的设计取舍——为什么本地客户端比网页更难做对</title>
      <link>https://wild-think-lab.github.io/wild-think/writing/kinglinux-design-tradeoffs/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://wild-think-lab.github.io/wild-think/writing/kinglinux-design-tradeoffs/</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>一个面向教学的全栈本地客户端，难点不在功能列表，而在&quot;多技术栈共存、可离线运行、可增量更新&quot;这三件事上。这里记录关键决策与踩过的坑。</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Linux 日志体系：journald 与 rsyslog 到底谁在写日志</title>
      <link>https://wild-think-lab.github.io/wild-think/writing/journald-rsyslog-architecture/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://wild-think-lab.github.io/wild-think/writing/journald-rsyslog-architecture/</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>搞清楚 journald、rsyslog 的分工与数据流，才能在两套日志之间快速定位故障，而不是把 /var/log 翻一遍碰运气。</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>实验：CentOS 7 YUM 源失效的四种修复路径</title>
      <link>https://wild-think-lab.github.io/wild-think/writing/centos7-yum-repair/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://wild-think-lab.github.io/wild-think/writing/centos7-yum-repair/</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>CentOS 7 停止维护后，默认源返回 404 或镜像站改路径，yum 全面不可用。按&quot;镜像站替换 / 本地仓库 / 内网代理 / 离线 RPM&quot;四条路径给出可执行脚本与验证方式。</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>镜像分层、写时复制与存储驱动：为什么容器磁盘会悄悄涨</title>
      <link>https://wild-think-lab.github.io/wild-think/writing/docker-layers-and-storage/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://wild-think-lab.github.io/wild-think/writing/docker-layers-and-storage/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>从镜像分层理解容器的读写机制，再解释 overlay2 下&quot;删了文件反而更占空间&quot;、磁盘持续增长的真实原因与治理手段。</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>子网划分与 VLSM：从需求反推掩码，而不是背公式</title>
      <link>https://wild-think-lab.github.io/wild-think/writing/subnetting-and-vlsm/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://wild-think-lab.github.io/wild-think/writing/subnetting-and-vlsm/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>常规划分适合&quot;每段人数相同&quot;的场景，VLSM 适合&quot;每段人数差异巨大&quot;的真实项目。两种做法都给出完整演算，并说明可浪费与不可浪费的边界。</description>
    </item>
    <item>
